@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam dpi 160
hide empty members
title 类图（二）：治理、任务、消息与统计（延续核心类图）
class "账号 User" as User
class "活动 Event" as Event
class "场次 EventSession" as Session
class "报名单 RegistrationOrder" as Order
class "手机号身份 PhoneIdentity" as Phone {
  +id, normalizedPhone: String
  +cancellationCount: Integer
  +lastCancelledAt: DateTime [0..1]
  +registrationBlacklisted: Boolean
}
class "登录会话 LoginSession" as Login {
  +id: UUID
  +tokenHash: String
  +expiresAt: DateTime
  +revokedAt: DateTime [0..1]
}
class "举报 Report" as Report {
  +id: UUID
  +reason, evidenceText: String
  +status, conclusion: String
}
class "违规事实 ViolationFact" as Fact {
  +id, factKey: String
  +occurredAt: DateTime
  +evidence: String
}
class "业务限制 BusinessRestriction" as Restriction {
  +id: UUID
  +kind: Publish | Register
  +startsAt, endsAt: DateTime
}
class "限制依据 RestrictionBasis" as Basis {
  +factId: UUID
  +restrictionKind: String
}
class "站内消息 InboxMessage" as Message {
  +eventKey: String
  +createdAt, expiresAt: DateTime
  +readAt, deletedAt: DateTime [0..1]
}
class "审计记录 AuditLog" as Log {
  +actorId: UUID [0..1]
  +actorRole: Role | SYSTEM
  +objectType, objectId: String
  +action, result, failureReason: String
  +createdAt: DateTime
}
class "持久任务 PersistentJob" as Job {
  +id: UUID
  +type, status: String
  +dueAt, deadlineAt: DateTime
  +progressCursor: String
}
class "终止逐单待办 TerminationItem" as Item {
  +effectiveAt: DateTime
  +eligibilitySnapshot: String
  +status, retryCount: Integer
}
class "统计快照 StatisticsSnapshot" as Stats {
  +scope: Session | Event
  +countsAndDenominators: String
  +reason: Natural | Cancel | Takedown
  +expiresAt: DateTime
}
class "导出文件 ExportFile" as Export {
  +id, ownerId: UUID
  +path: String
  +expiresAt: DateTime
}
Phone "0..1" -- "0..*" User : 跨注销重注册关联 >
User "1" -- "0..*" Login
User "1" -- "0..*" Report : 举报人 >
Session "1" -- "0..*" Report
Event "1" -- "0..*" Fact
Phone "1" -- "0..*" Restriction
Restriction "1" -- "1..*" Basis
Basis ..> Fact : 组织者违规依据
Basis ..> Order : 参与者缺席／主动退款依据
User "1" -- "0..*" Message : 接收人 >
Event "0..1" -- "0..*" Job
Job "1" *-- "0..*" Item
Order "1" -- "0..*" Item
Event "1" -- "0..*" Stats
Session "0..1" -- "0..*" Stats : 场次级快照 >
Event "1" -- "0..*" Export
Log ..> User : 保存操作人内部编号
Log ..> Job : SYSTEM含任务类型
note bottom of Restriction
  参与者/组织者必须关联手机号身份；管理员/检票员不强制填手机号。
  购票/发布锁定不等于账号停用；已有占位仍可履约。
  同活动同事实只处罚一次；同事实不重复触发同类限制。
  手机号保存注销及限制计数，第三次注销后禁止注册。
end note
note bottom of Item
  终止生效和待办依据同事务保存；逐单事务结算，可恢复重试。
  使用终止时刻事实，不按任务执行时刻重算退款资格。
  终止任务5分钟，普通清理/递补/自然结算1分钟。
end note
note bottom of Stats
  场次结算完才生成；活动加总分子分母再计算。
  实时计数直接查询，不伪造正式快照。
  名单/快照/导出均至活动实际终结后7天，禁止到期重建。
end note
note bottom of Message
  eventKey+接收人唯一；与业务同事务。
  消息180天逻辑删除；日志180天物理删除。
  底层订单/支付/退款/票/签到保留，日志不级联删除。
end note
legend bottom
  结构性图；REQ-019～022、026、028～032、041～043、045～046、048～053。
  类名和存储拆分为设计选择；图省略字段不代表取消原需求。
endlegend
@enduml

